## Decision Trees

### When to Use Which Mode/Phase

{{Decision tree for choosing execution mode}}

```
┌─ User wants backend only?
│   └─ YES → Use --backend-only (Phase 1)
│   └─ NO  → Continue
│
├─ User wants frontend only?
│   └─ YES → Use --frontend-only (Phase 2)
│   └─ NO  → Continue
│
├─ User wants complete module?
│   └─ YES → Use --all-phases
│   └─ NO  → Ask for clarification
```

### Error Handling Decision Tree

{{How to handle different error scenarios}}

```
┌─ Error: Entity already exists
│   ├─ Check if user wants to overwrite
│   │   └─ YES → Overwrite with warning
│   │   └─ NO  → Abort with safe exit
│
├─ Error: Invalid entity name
│   ├─ Suggest valid name format
│   └─ Ask user to retry
│
└─ Error: Missing dependencies
    ├─ List missing dependencies
    └─ Provide installation instructions
```

